+
+/// A span that starts exactly on the bottom cylinder and rises into the
+/// band keeps its start edge (the old `ra > lo` dropped it) and is cut at
+/// the R2 crossing.
+#[test]
+fn a_span_starting_on_the_bottom_edge_keeps_its_start() {
